  "bodyHash": "2cffafe7f073baab",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"標誌\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <strong>為《我的世界》添加多種新生物，讓世界感覺更加生動</strong> </span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">遊戲內關於生物／物品的資訊透過 <strong>Patchouli</strong>（由 Vazkii 開發）提供&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下載</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">（非強制性，但<strong>強烈建議</strong>安裝）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組支援 Forge、Fabric（自 1.18.2 起）與 NeoForge（自 1.20.4 起）。請查看「檔案」標籤頁以查看所有版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 版本需要 Fabric-API</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此取得</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">關於生物／物品的詳細資訊可於<strong>維基</strong>網站查詢&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊前往</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如需遊戲內圖片，請查看圖庫</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\">大象</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\">長頸鹿</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\">獅子</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\">鯊魚</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\">企鵝</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PShrSK2/x170-elephant.png\" alt=\"大象\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/d4v4Vk38/x170-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"長頸鹿\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWPR0c5y/x170-lion.png\" alt=\"獅子\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kGxr6Mk/x170-shark.png\" alt=\"鯊魚\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6SkjYSc/x170-penguin.png\" alt=\"企鵝\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">鴕鳥</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\">火鶴</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\">魟魚</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">浣熊</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z12Wtz4W/x170-ostrich.png\" alt=\"鴕鳥\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n8nRjdgs/x170-flamingo.png\" alt=\"火鶴\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zhPLtBkR/x170-crab-red.png\" alt=\"螃蟹\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4n7jGDDL/x170-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"魟魚\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YBndBzHc/x170-raccoon.png\" alt=\"浣熊\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\">貓頭鷹</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\">遠古烈焰人</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\">無尾熊</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\">蝸牛</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\">猴子</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ymP9Qjbv/x170-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"貓頭鷹\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CpW4Kx6c/x170-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"遠古烈焰人\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9k24KZsm/x170-koala.png\" alt=\"無尾熊\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dJ1vdgjq/x170-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"蝸牛\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/99FHb035/x170-monkey.png\" alt=\"猴子\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界騎士</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇人</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\">海馬</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影龍幼崽</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\">孔雀</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/q3F0xV3H/x170-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"下界騎士\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rK4xbM0p/x170-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"蘑菇人\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/27R8skfB/x170-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"海馬\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TD4RGbsB/x170-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"末影龍幼崽\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tGS4jmy/x170-peacock.png\" alt=\"孔雀\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您對本模組有任何問題，或想了解即將推出的新功能： </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎加入我的&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a> </span></p>",
